WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
[music]

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
I was a kid looking for love, full of hope inside.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.000
[music and singing] But time was never kind to me.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
My heart grew cold as ice. All out of luck.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Thought I was stuck alone for all my life.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
But I was proven wrong the moment I looked in your eyes.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.000
It's true.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Until I'm in the grave.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Darling, I love you for a thousand years.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Dear, time is nothing when I'm here with you.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Oh my fears, tears, those memories disappear with you.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:49.000
[music]

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Till I turn to dust.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.000
I'm curious of my death for a thousand years.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[music]

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.000
[music]

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Soon something will bloom like a lotus flower.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.000
The blessed moon will soon be sun and turn to golden hour.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Hours and days lost in your gaze, losing track of time.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.000
Learning how to slow it down. Appreciate our lives.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Just know until I'm in the grave.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Darling, I love you for a thousand years.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Tell me nothing when I'm here with you.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:40.000
All my fears, tears, those memories that disappear with you.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Till I turn into dust.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:03.000
[music]

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:07.000
[music]

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.000
On fire. Let it burn bright.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:13.000
On the liar.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:19.000
[music]

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:23.000
I love you for a thousand years.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:26.000
Dear, time is nothing when I'm here with you.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:30.000
All my fears, tears, those memories that disappear with you.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Oh my.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:46.000
[music]

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:54.000
[music] for a thousand years.